- `cd daemon && cargo build --release --benches` — confirms the bench compiles in release profile without warnings the task introduced.
- `cd daemon && cargo bench --bench baseline_workflows -- --warm-up-time 1 --measurement-time 3` — confirms the bench runs end-to-end and emits criterion output; passing means the metrics file is regenerated on each run.

