nose_failure`, `record_workflow_outcome`, `save_observation`) and the per-event helpers.\n  - T16: daemon-managed background compactor + versioned independently-readable snapshot header + `Bootstrap::load`; architecture doc required.\n  - T17: ordering/replay/corruption/scoping/P99 tests gated with `--include-ignored` for budget tests.\n  - T19: full 13-class taxonomy including CounterMemory + every spec-required field + denormalized scope columns + architecture doc.\n  - T20: all 11 link types, four first-class tables with explicit column lists, evidence anchors with span sha256 for Phase 7.\n  - T21: seven streams + total `classify_stream` over `MemoryClass` + deny-by-default `ScopeFilter`.\n  - T22: idempotent restartable migrator with dry-run + CLI + crash recovery + architecture doc with column-mapping table.\n  - T23: CRUD + idempotency table + full verification-status state machine with allowed/disallowed transitions enumerated, every transition emits the right lifecycle event.\n  - T24: contradiction (link vs CounterMemory distinction), supersession chains + cycle rejection, replay byte-equivalence, exhaustive link-type coverage.\n  - R18: review structure with the required `## P99 budget evidence` section.\n  - R25: review structure with the required `## CounterMemory coverage` section.\n  - R26: contract gate with `## Contract surfaces`, `## Round-trip evidence`, `## Schema regression coverage`, plus the requirement to add and pass `contract_tests::identity_event_memory`.\n\nNo code was implemented; no modifications were made to tasks.json, context.md, or plan.md."}],"totalDurationMs":765124,"totalTokens":115872,"totalToolUseCount":29,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":416,"cache_read_input_tokens":114179,"output_tokens":1276,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":416},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"inpu