+- The bench harness now falls back to `/tmp/lattice-benchmarks/baseline_metrics.json` instead of failing. After the successful `cargo bench` run, that shadow snapshot was copied back to the required repo path so the checked-in artifact exists with the recorded numbers.
+- Initial fixture setup assumed `get_context_capsule` would always return a pivot. The harness was corrected to seed `expand_context` from either a pivot or a context hit.
+
+## Final status
